<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 97,845.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 97,845.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of January 24 totaled 97,845 bales, up from 96,438 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,407 bales issued, 3,019 decertification orders,no cancellations, and 7,239 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640))</p>
